`\n- `logs/do-work-20261018-172551.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n\n1. Check out the preserved branch and rerun `generateLibraryStats` or `jacocoCodeCoverageReport` with `--stacktrace --info` to identify the class or coverage input JaCoCo cannot analyze.\n2. Correct the JaCoCo/reporting incompatibility, and review whether the added Native Image build arguments—especially build-time initialization of `org.xml.sax.helpers.LocatorImpl`—are strictly necessary and compliant with the test contract.\n3. Rerun the coordinate-scoped metadata, JVM/native test, dynamic-access coverage, and library-statistics tasks; confirm nonzero, schema-valid metrics before publication.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0922849265623c5b016ad827c57d8887d09cbf8364e17de1aa\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 8942, "output": 965, "cacheRead": 120704, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 480, "totalTokens": 130611, "cost": {"input": 0.035768, "output": 0.0193, "cacheRead": 0.0482816, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.10334960000000001}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1792550841127, "responseId": "resp_0922849265623c5b016ad827b9cb3887d09c16eedc1fd3570d", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
